The '''Wand of Restoration''' is an {{Epic}} [[Healing Wand]] and [[Support items|Support Item]] unlocked at {{Coll|Zombie Slayer 6}}. It is an upgraded version of the {{Item|Wand of Mending}} and can be upgraded into the {{Item|Wand of Atonement}}.

